<title>SOUTH AFRICA: BOE, BOE Corp say in talks.</title>
<headline>BOE, BOE Corp say in talks.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Board of Executors Ltd (BOE) and BOE Corp Ltd said on Wednesday they were in negotiations which if successfully concluded could have an effect on their share prices.</p>
<p>No further details were given in the brief announcement but shareholders were advised to exercise caution when dealing in these companies' shares.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
